OL,3,A'I only found out this morning': Freed
OL,4,Aprisoners speak to BBC as new early
OL,5,Arelease scheme begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FJake Sykes says he will be fitted with
OL,8,Fa tag, given a curfew and banned from
OL,9,Fgoing to pubs as conditions of his
OL,10,Fearly release, while Benjamin Stewart
OL,11,Fsays he didn't know he was being
OL,12,Freleased until this morning
OL,14,FVictims are questioning how they will
OL,15,Fbe protected. One woman, whose
OL,16,Fex-partner was convicted of coercive
OL,17,Fbehaviour and is due for early release,
OL,18,Fsays she's "fearing for her life"
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
