OL,3,AToo early to say if Iran involved in
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack, Israeli
OL,5,APM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe stabbed pilot, Indian national
OL,8,FCaptain Smit Machchhar, is in hospital
OL,9,Fin a stable condition, and has been
OL,10,Fhailed a "true hero" by Prime Minister
OL,11,FBenjamin Netanyahu.
OL,13,FOne passenger, Yaniv Hayun, described
OL,14,Fhow he put the attacker, who was trying
OL,15,Fto disable the plane, in a chokehold
OL,16,Fbefore other passengers helped pin him
OL,17,Fdown.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
